        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Romscot">Rom.</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit hwa forgumie, gylde LX scill' 7 be twelffealdan agife þene Rómpenincg.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone misses [this date], he should pay [a fine of] 60 shillings, and pay twelve times [the Peter's pence].</ab>
